{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Lilia approaches the center, right in front of the Hanging Tree. Two crows swoop seemingly out of thin air and perch themselves onto it, watching . The air around her turns icy. Her eyes become black. She lifts her staff in the air and brings it back down to the ground, at the base of three. When this happens the faint outline of her black wings grow in opaqueness. She now speaks loudly and clearly, for everyone to hear her words.","created_at":"2020-08-17T08:55:13.956000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744841759502106624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
