{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"“Raven Queen, thank you for hearing my prayers and for watching over us all. Thank you for allowing me to bless this land in your honor. We will fight for you and the other gods. Any death that may befall us will be in honor of you, for we fight to defend all divine power. By blessing this land I declare it sacred where no Celestial, Elemental, Fey, Fiend or Undead may enter,  nor can they charm, frighten, or possess those who reside within it. While on this land the residents of Roanoke dedicated to defeating the Hunger and its allies, they will have the courage to fight. They will be immune to being frightened, while here. Raven Queen I know you watch us, I know you hear us, I know you are eager to see the Hunger fall. Those who sought to see your power here, left offerings, momentos, keepsakes, trinkets, all filled with powerful memories. They wish to honor you as I bless this land. Goddess of Death I implore you help restore balance to this island, help aid us in the fight against a great evil. Death cannot come if life cannot thrive.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T08:55:27.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744841815991255090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
