{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"As the final words are spoken, Lilia’s wings spread out to their fullest extent. She looks almost dead, yet there is much energy surging from her and over the land. For a brief moment a dome of faint light is seen over the area forever marking the effects of the Hallow ritual. As her wings fade and life returns to her face and her eyes become bright green again. The two crows on the tree swoop down each picking up an offering. They take their offerings then fly off disappearing in thin air. The ritual was a success.","created_at":"2020-08-17T08:55:42.232000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744841878100508682","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
