{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Copper turns to <@!260949833773219840> , “you did well my friend. Thank you for assisting me in protecting Lilia. I could understand wanting to be in the fight, to attain the glory, but we had an important job to do back here. Some people may try say you did nothing this fight. Do not let them speak down to your accomplishments here. If we were not here to defend, and the front line failed, than all this work would have been for nothing. Thank you very much my friend.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T08:57:54.680000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744842433627422774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
